cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  参考に何か作ったときは、どこかに書いてもらえるとうれしいです。
  If you build something based on this, a credit like this would be appreciated:
  "Based on symysak/arib — https://github.com/symysak/arib".
title: arib
abstract: >-
  ARIB 標準規格のデジタル無線（市町村デジタル同報通信システムの STD-T86 / STD-T115、
  都道府県・市町村デジタル移動通信システムの STD-T79 など）を SDR で受信して、ブラウザで見て聴くための受信デコーダ。
  Receiver decoders for Japanese digital radio systems standardized by ARIB
  (STD-T86 / STD-T115 municipal broadcast radio, STD-T79 prefectural/municipal digital mobile radio, and more),
  with a live web monitor.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: symysak
repository-code: "https://github.com/symysak/arib"
url: "https://github.com/symysak/arib"
keywords:
  - ARIB STD-T86
  - ARIB STD-T115
  - ARIB STD-T79
  - SDR
  - decoder
